{% comment %}
  The "build with Claude Code" call to action, and the two scripts that drive
  it. Self-contained so a page opts in by including it - nothing is loaded on
  pages that do not.
{% endcomment %}

<p class="build-or">or</p>

<button id="bwc-launch" type="button" class="primary-cta bwc-launch" data-umami-event="bwc-deeplink">
  Open in Claude Code
</button>

{% comment %}
  Rendered explicitly by src/build-with-claude.ts with execution "render", so
  nothing is allocated until the button is clicked and the challenge stays out
  of the page unless Turnstile wants an interaction.
{% endcomment %}
<div id="bwc-turnstile" class="bwc-turnstile"></div>

<p id="bwc-error" class="bwc-error" hidden></p>

<div id="bwc-result" class="bwc-result" hidden>
  <p id="bwc-reserved" class="bwc-note">
    Reserved <code id="bwc-name" class="bwc-code"></code> for the next two hours.
  </p>

  <details class="bwc-details">
    <summary>Prefer a cloud session, or nothing happened?</summary>
    <p class="bwc-note">
      The button needs Claude Code installed on this machine. Otherwise copy this — it starts a session on Anthropic's
      infrastructure:
    </p>
    <div class="bwc-copy-row">
      <pre id="bwc-command" class="bwc-command"></pre>
      <button id="bwc-copy" type="button" class="bwc-copy" data-umami-event="bwc-copy-command">Copy</button>
    </div>
    <p class="bwc-note">
      A cloud session needs
      <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/cloud-environments" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
        >a network environment</a
      >
      that allows <code class="bwc-code">api.archival.dev</code> — the default list does not. Publishing fails without
      it.
    </p>
    <p class="bwc-note">
      No Claude Code?
      <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/quickstart" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Install it here</a>, or
      <a href="https://editor.archival.dev/new">build a site in the editor</a>.
    </p>
  </details>
</div>

<script
  src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?onload=onloadTurnstileCallback&render=explicit"
  async
  defer
></script>
<script type="module" src="/scripts/build-with-claude.js"></script>
